---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Templates | Aging at Home Lab" description="Printable caregiver checklists, planning tools, and aging-in-place templates.">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Templates</p>
    <h1>Printable tools for safer, more organized care.</h1>
    <p>The template library will include practical PDF and web-based tools for families who need to organize care information and home-safety tasks quickly.</p>

    <h2>In development</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card">
        <h3>Aging at Home Master Checklist</h3>
        <p>A room-by-room checklist for first-pass home safety and caregiver organization.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="card">
        <h3>Family Caregiver Binder</h3>
        <p>Emergency contacts, medication lists, doctors, appointments, home access instructions, and care notes.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="card">
        <h3>Medication List Template</h3>
        <p>A simple worksheet for medication name, dose, schedule, prescriber, pharmacy, and important notes.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="card">
        <h3>Sibling Coordination Worksheet</h3>
        <p>A practical way to divide appointments, groceries, check-ins, home tasks, pharmacy pickups, and paperwork.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
